External dependencies
---------------------

None. The package uses only the Python standard library.

CiA 402 is the CANopen device profile for drives and motion control
(IEC 61800-7-201). This package implements parts of that profile from
its published behaviour. It contains no text of the standard, and it is
not affiliated with, certified by or endorsed by CAN in Automation, the
EtherCAT Technology Group, or any drive manufacturer.


